---
description: Add compact end-of-response review notes after implementation work
alwaysApply: true
---

For this project, whenever you make code changes or modify files, end the response with:

Review notes
- Changed: <very short summary>
- Check: <main thing to verify, or "none">
- Next: <best next action>

Rules:
- Keep each line short.
- Do not exceed 3 bullets.
- Do not add this section when no files/code were changed.
- Do not add unnecessary explanation before or after it.
- Prefer concrete file names when useful.
